## 🤔 Thoughts after 3 years:
It's been three years since I last looked at this project, and I can now see many areas for improvement — naming conventions, overall architecture or UX (Makefile output).

I’ve decided to leave it untouched as a snapshot of my progress. It's a valuable reminder of the path I've taken so far.